# Materials for crate.obj.
#
# The texture paths are relative to THIS file, which is how every real exporter
# writes them; the importer resolves them against the model's directory and then
# re-expresses them relative to the content root, so they come out as
# "Textures/checker_orange.png" and feed straight into the texture cache.

newmtl crate_body
Kd 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
map_Kd ../Textures/checker_orange.png

newmtl crate_trim
Kd 0.750000 0.800000 0.850000
map_Kd ../Textures/dev_grid.png
